        <section>
          <h2 className="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">1. Cancellation by Students</h2>
          <p>
            Users may cancel their study desk bookings directly through the LiBrowse app. The eligibility for a refund, as well as any applicable cancellation fees, depends strictly on the specific cancellation policy set by the Library Owner at the time of booking.
